sequenceDiagram
    actor Viewer as 👤 Viewer
    participant Browser as ⚛️ Browser + hls.js
    participant NGINX as 🚦 NGINX
    participant SS as ▶️ Streaming Service
    participant Redis as ⚡ Redis Cache
    participant Disk as 💾 Disk (HLS files)
    participant HAPI as 📊 Heatmap API
    participant EI as 📡 Event Ingestion
    participant Kafka as 📨 Kafka
    participant HAG as 🌡️ Heatmap Aggregator
    participant TS as 📈 Trending Service

    Viewer->>Browser: Click a video to watch

    par Load video stream
        Browser->>NGINX: GET /stream/{videoId}/manifest.m3u8
        NGINX->>SS: Forward request
        SS->>Redis: Check cache → stream:manifest:{vid}
        alt Cache HIT (fast ⚡)
            Redis-->>SS: Return cached manifest
        else Cache MISS (first time)
            SS->>Disk: Read .m3u8 playlist file
            SS->>Redis: Store in cache
        end
        SS-->>Browser: HLS manifest (quality options)
        Browser->>Browser: hls.js picks best quality\nbased on internet speed
        loop Continuous streaming
            Browser->>NGINX: GET /stream/{videoId}/{chunk}.ts
            NGINX->>SS: Forward
            SS->>Disk: Read video chunk
            SS-->>Browser: Video segment (.ts file)
        end
    and Load live heatmap
        Browser->>NGINX: GET /api/heatmap/{videoId}
        NGINX->>HAPI: Forward
        HAPI->>Redis: Read heatmap:{vid}:live:* counters
        HAPI-->>Browser: Heat scores per 5-sec segment
        Browser->>Browser: recharts renders 🔴🟠🟡🟢🔵 color bar
    end

    Note over Browser,HAG: Every few seconds while watching → silent background events

    loop Every viewer action (play, pause, seek)
        Browser->>NGINX: POST /api/events {type, videoId, position}
        NGINX->>EI: Forward
        EI->>Redis: Check rate limit (max 100/min)
        EI-->>Browser: 202 Accepted ← IMMEDIATE, never waits!
        EI->>Kafka: Publish → viewer-interaction-events

        par Update heatmap
            Kafka->>HAG: Consume event
            HAG->>Redis: INCR heatmap:{vid}:live:{bucket}
            HAG->>Redis: INCR heatmap:{vid}:total:{bucket}
        and Update trending
            Kafka->>TS: Consume event
            TS->>Redis: ZINCRBY trending:videos {videoId}
        end
    end

    Note over Browser,HAG: Heatmap bar updates in real-time via SSE 🎨
